Well, I just won castle, and what and ending!

	[nothing]

In fact, all that you see if you do kill "The Wiz" (who is the 'win'
creature) is the screen clears, and you see:

                    You were killed by Old Age.
                    Better Luck Next Time!

This leads me to believe that I did something wrong.  I haven't made any
changes yet, but I recommend that you edit the death() routine in castle.c,
do a strcmp(tmp.death_by,"Old Age"), and if you have a match, have some
sort of fanfare to tell the player that he won, hurray and all that, etc.

